  "units": [
    {
      "end_seconds": 3.325,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-1",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 0.0,
      "text": "刚才在餐馆喝了一个 Barbaresco,"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 5.775,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-2",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 3.325,
      "text": "讲到说 Barbaresco 跟"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 9.476,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-3",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 5.95,
      "text": "Barolo 一个是意大利红酒皇后,一个"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 12.1,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-4",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 9.476,
      "text": "是意大利红酒之王那么现在喝一个红酒之王"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 13.182,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-5",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 12.1,
      "text": "就是 Barolo 它跟"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 15.091,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-6",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 13.273,
      "text": "Barbaresco 用的是同一种葡萄,"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 17.094,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-7",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 15.091,
      "text": "叫 Nebbiolo 然后这一个款的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 19.594,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-8",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 17.25,
      "text": "Nebbiolo 这个厂家叫做"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 22.5,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-9",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 19.75,
      "text": "Casetta 然后它上面除了告诉你"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 25.1,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-10",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 22.65,
      "text": "Barolo 里面还告诉你很重要的信息,"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 26.0,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-11",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 25.1,
      "text": "叫 Riserva"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 31.455,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-12",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 26.0,
      "text": "说明它是一个陈酿过的 Barolo 但你"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 36.0,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-13",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 31.455,
      "text": "会想说,这瓶看年份已经是 1990 年了"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 37.0,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-14",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 36.0,
      "text": "所以这个 Riserva 什么意思呢?"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 39.5,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-15",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 37.0,
      "text": "其实这个 Riserva 讲的是,它在出"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 43.556,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-16",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 39.5,
      "text": "酒庄之前它在它的木桶里面至少陈年 5 年"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 46.0,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-17",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 43.556,
      "text": "以上为什么这对 Barolo 很重要?"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 48.4,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-18",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 46.0,
      "text": "因为 Barolo,刚才说它的酒体很强劲"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 52.75,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-19",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 48.4,
      "text": ",单宁厚重所以大部分的传统的酒庄它会选择"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 55.941,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-20",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 52.75,
      "text": "在木桶当中陈年很久的时间很多人会陈年 5"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 57.0,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-21",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 56.059,
      "text": "年,至少 5 年"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 59.4,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-22",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 57.0,
      "text": "然后很多人会选择陈年 10 年以后才会在"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 63.111,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-23",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 59.4,
      "text": "市场出一卖因为如果在那之前的话,出来的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 65.75,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-24",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 63.111,
      "text": "酒太涩了大家其实喝不了所以这个"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 69.846,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-25",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 65.938,
      "text": "Riserva 告诉你它至少葡萄榨完汁"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 73.857,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-26",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 69.846,
      "text": "酿成酒以后它在一个很大的木桶里面至少陈年"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 77.1,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-27",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 74.048,
      "text": "5 年以上在它的背标也说了一句话,至少"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 79.059,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-28",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 77.1,
      "text": "陈年 5 年这样的话才能被称为"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 84.0,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-29",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 79.176,
      "text": "Riserva 就是这种真选真样子的酒"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 87.0,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-30",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 84.0,
      "text": "这瓶我们刚才讲的时候已经是 90 年了"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 91.286,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-31",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 87.0,
      "text": "所以它喝上去它的那种陈年过程中给你带来的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 93.0,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-32",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 91.286,
      "text": "味道会更丰富一点"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 96.619,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-33",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 93.0,
      "text": "所以像我闻上去的话会闻到很浓郁的蘑菇的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 101.636,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-34",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 96.619,
      "text": "味道是一种你可以想象那种新鲜蘑菇被打碎"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 107.643,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-35",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 101.636,
      "text": "以后的味道它会闻到一点点果味但是比较"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 111.455,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-36",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 107.643,
      "text": "淡像靖晨刚才讲说它是梅子味我觉得这个说的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 116.25,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-37",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 111.455,
      "text": "很贴切我也可以闻到一些红梅或者说话梅或者"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 118.759,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-38",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 116.25,
      "text": "乌梅的这种感觉然后还有一点点 Raw"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 120.5,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-39",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 118.828,
      "text": "Fruit 像 Cranberry 然后"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 125.111,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-40",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 120.5,
      "text": "一点点甜甜的 Oak 的味道让它喝上去的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 128.815,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-41",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 125.111,
      "text": "时候我个人感觉它已经有点过了它的最佳适饮"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 132.0,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-42",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 128.815,
      "text": "年因为它刚开始我的酸度的感觉非常高"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 136.762,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-43",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 132.0,
      "text": "只可以理解为酒精在缓慢氧化过程中慢慢变成"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 140.913,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-44",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 136.762,
      "text": "酸然后它尾韵的话其实刚才也有朋友提到它"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 144.812,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-45",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 140.913,
      "text": "非常的优雅就是它的那种酒精灼烧感不是那么"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 148.065,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-46",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 144.812,
      "text": "强它在陈年过程中它的酒精可能一方面是蒸发"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 150.514,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-47",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 148.065,
      "text": "一方面它已经融合的非常好然后它也有跟"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 151.886,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-48",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 150.6,
      "text": "Barbaresco 刚才我喝的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 153.933,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-49",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 151.971,
      "text": "Barbaresco 一样它也有很浓郁的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 156.6,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-50",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 153.933,
      "text": "一种 savoriness 就是一种鲜度"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 160.4,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-51",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 156.6,
      "text": "在里面一直很悠长总的来说我觉得是一瓶不错"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 167.0,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-52",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 160.4,
      "text": "喝的酒我觉得如果能提前 5 年喝它的果味"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 170.267,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-53",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 167.0,
      "text": "如果能再突出一点它还能再多一点单宁的话我"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 175.059,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-54",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 170.267,
      "text": "觉得会是一个更加平衡的一瓶酒现在喝上去我"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 178.227,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-55",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 175.059,
      "text": "觉得它的酸度有点太高了但是其实我刚才放了"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 180.667,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-56",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 178.227,
      "text": "一口我觉得现在喝上去也不错酸度感觉没有"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 183.385,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-57",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 180.667,
      "text": "那么高也许是温度的原因对这就是我们现在喝"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 186.2,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-58",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 183.385,
      "text": "的瓶 90 年的 Barolo 好"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 187.0,
      "id": "youtube-SqnAN2nx0qc#cue-59",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 186.2,
      "text": "谢谢大家"
    }
  ],
